"""PhishLens: a polished Streamlit workspace for saved phishing classifiers.

Run locally or in BITS Virtual Lab with:
    streamlit run app.py

This application loads the five pipelines produced by training.py. It does not
fit, retrain, or overwrite any model when a labelled CSV is uploaded.
"""

